th America, Australia, Europe, and internationally. The company operates through four segments: North America Cruise Operations, Europe Cruise Operations, Cruise Support, and Tour and Other. It operates port destinations and islands, as well as owns and operates hotels, lodges, glass-domed railcars, and motorcoaches. The company offers its services under the AIDA Cruises, Carnival Cruise Line, Costa Cruises, Cunard, Holland America Line, P&O Cruises (Australia), P&O Cruises (UK), Princess Cruises, and Seabourn brands. It sells its cruises through travel agents, tour operators, vacation planners, websites, and onboard future cruise consultants. Carnival Corporation Ltd. was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Miami, Florida.', 160000.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Michael Meir Arison", "age": 76, "title": "Executive Chairman of the Board", "yearBorn": 1949, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 126507, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Joshua Ian Weinstein", "age": 51, "title": "CEO & Director", "yearBorn": 1974, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 6926749, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. David  Bernstein", "age": 67, "title": "CFO & Chief Accounting Officer", "yearBorn": 1958, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 3574533, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Enrique  Miguez J.D.", "age": 60, "title": "General Counsel", "yearBorn": 1965, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1919353, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Bettina A. Deynes", "age": 52, "title": "Global Chief Human Resources Officer", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1532644, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Lars  Ljoen", "age": 55, "title": "Chief Maritime Officer", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1848443, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Beth  Roberts", "title"