ership subsidiary, Digital Realty Trust, L.P. The company is focused on providing data center, colocation, and interconnection solutions for domestic and international customers across a variety of industry verticals ranging from cloud and information technology services, communications and social networking to financial services, manufacturing, energy, healthcare, and consumer products. As of March 31, 2026, the company\'s 309 data centers, including 89 data centers held as investments in unconsolidated entities, contain applications and operations critical to the day-to-day operations of technology industry and corporate enterprise data center customers. Digital Realty\'s portfolio is comprised of approximately 3.0 gigawatts of IT capacity, as well as approximately 6.3 gigawatts of buildable IT capacity under active development and held for future development, located throughout North America, Europe, South America, Asia, Australia, and Africa. Digital Realty Trust, Inc. was established on March 09, 2004 and is based in Dallas, United States.', 4282.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Andrew P. Power", "age": 45, "title": "President, CEO & Director", "yearBorn": 1980, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 6896813, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Matthew R. Mercier", "age": 45, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1980, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2039441, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Jeannie  Lee", "age": 48, "title": "Executive VP, General Counsel & Secretary", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1641275, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Siew Noi  Nah", "age": 45, "title": "MD & Head of Asia Pacific", "yearBorn": 1980, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Steven J. Smith", "age": 60, "title": "Managing Director of Americas", "yearBorn": 1965, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercis