ion and distribution of electric power. The company supplies and delivers through its electrical infrastructure to an approximately 50,000 square-mile area of southern, central, and coastal California. It serves residential, commercial, industrial, public authorities, agricultural, street lighting, and other sectors. The company\'s distribution network consists of approximately 13,000 circuit-miles of lines ranging from 55 kV to 500 kV and approximately 80 transmission substations; and approximately 38,000 circuit-miles of overhead lines, approximately 32,000 circuit-miles of underground lines, and approximately 730 distribution substations. Edison International was founded in 1886 and is based in Rosemead, California.', 13725.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Pedro J. Pizarro Ph.D.", "age": 59, "title": "President, CEO & Director", "yearBorn": 1966, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 4763780, "exercisedValue": 1818094, "unexercisedValue": 2706287}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Maria C. Rigatti", "age": 61, "title": "Executive VP & CFO", "yearBorn": 1964, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2075013, "exercisedValue": 366525, "unexercisedValue": 628137}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Chonda Jordan Nwamu Esq.", "age": 54, "title": "Executive VP & General Counsel", "yearBorn": 1971, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2625454, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Jill C. Anderson", "age": 44, "title": "Executive VP & COO - SCE", "yearBorn": 1981, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2320204, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 104607}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Steven D. Powell", "age": 46, "title": "President & CEO of SCE", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2997268, "exercisedValue": 112808, "unexercisedValue": 252143}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Kara Gostenhofer Ryan", "age": 41, "title": "VP, Chief Accounting Officer & Controller", "yearBorn": 1984, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name