any primarily explores for copper, gold, molybdenum, silver, and other metals. Its assets include the Grasberg minerals district in Indonesia; Morenci, Bagdad, Safford, Sierrita, and Miami in Arizona; Chino and Tyrone in New Mexico; and Henderson and Climax in Colorado, North America, as well as Cerro Verde in Peru and El Abra in Chile. The company was formerly known as Freeport-McMoRan Copper & Gold Inc. and changed its name to Freeport-McMoRan Inc. in July 2014. The company was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona.', 29000.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Kathleen Lynne Quirk", "age": 61, "title": "CEO, President & Director", "yearBorn": 1964, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 3007529, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 30896940}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Maree E. Robertson", "age": 49, "title": "Executive VP & CFO", "yearBorn": 1976, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1690079, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Stephen T. Higgins", "age": 67, "title": "Executive VP & Chief Administrative Officer", "yearBorn": 1958, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1429566, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Douglas N. Currault II", "age": 60, "title": "Executive VP & General Counsel", "yearBorn": 1965, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1301254, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 5775500}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Ellie L. Mikes", "age": 47, "title": "VP & Chief Accounting Officer", "yearBorn": 1978, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Bertrand L. Odinet II", "title": "Senior VP, Chief Information Officer & Chief Innovation Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. David  Joint", "title": "Vice President of Investor Relations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Pamela Q. Masson", "title": "Senior VP & Chie