ed packaging in North America, Latin America, Europe, South America, and North Africa. It operates through two segments, Packaging Solutions North America and Packaging Solutions EMEA. The company offers linerboard, medium, whitetop, and saturating kraft; and converts containerboard into corrugated boxes, bulk bins, shipping containers and specialty packaging through its converting facilities. Its products support customers in various industries, such as food and beverage, agriculture, industrial manufacturing, personal care pharmaceuticals and consumer goods. The company was founded in 1898 and is headquartered in Memphis, Tennessee.', 62602.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Andrew K. Silvernail", "age": 54, "title": "CEO & Chairman", "yearBorn": 1971, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2663506, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Lance T. Loeffler", "age": 48, "title": "Senior VP & CFO", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1676548, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Joseph R. Saab", "age": 56, "title": "Senior VP, General Counsel & Corporate Secretary", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1308098, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Timothy S. Nicholls", "age": 64, "title": "Executive VP & President of DS Smith", "yearBorn": 1961, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2896378, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. William Thomas Hamic", "age": 59, "title": "EVP & President of North American Packaging Solutions", "yearBorn": 1966, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1600429, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Michael H. Anderson", "title": "VP & Chief Information Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mandi  Gilliland", "title": "Senior Director of Investor Relations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercised