cisions and performance on an organization\'s mission-critical priorities in the United States, Canada, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Insights, Conferences, and Consulting. The Research segment delivers insights through subscription services, such as access to published content, data and benchmarks, and direct access to a network of business and technology experts. The Conferences segment offers executives and teams in an organization the opportunity to learn, share, and network through its Symposium/Xpo series and peer-driven sessions, as well as conferences focused on specific business roles and topics. The Consulting segment provides technology-driven strategic initiatives, including custom analysis and on-the-ground support to senior executives. This segment also offers actionable solutions for IT-related priorities, including IT cost optimization, digital transformation, and IT sourcing optimization. Gartner, Inc. was founded in 1979 and is headquartered in Stamford, Connecticut.', 19367.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Eugene A. Hall", "age": 68, "title": "CEO & Chairman", "yearBorn": 1957, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2627171, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 1181773}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Craig W. Safian CPA", "age": 56, "title": "Executive VP & CFO", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1650667, "exercisedValue": 3118664, "unexercisedValue": 1371763}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Thomas Sang Kim", "age": 53, "title": "Executive VP, Chief Legal Officer & Corporate Secretary", "yearBorn": 1972, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1361848, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Robin B. Kranich", "age": 54, "title": "Executive VP & Chief Human Resources Officer", "yearBorn": 1971, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1366970, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 827872}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Scott C. Hensel", "age": 52, "title": "Executive V