s technical athletic apparel, footwear, and accessories for women and men under the lululemon brand in the United States, Canada, Mexico, China Mainland, Hong Kong, Taiwan, Macau, and internationally. It offers pants, shorts, tops, and jackets for athletic activities, such as yoga, running, training, and other activities. The company also provides fitness-inspired accessories. It sells its products through company-operated stores; seasonal stores, pop-ups, university campus retailers, and yoga and fitness studios; outlets; Like New, a re-commerce program; and its e-commerce website. The company was founded in 1998 and is based in Vancouver, Canada.', 39000.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Martha A. M. Morfitt", "age": 67, "title": "Executive Chair", "yearBorn": 1958, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 342308, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Meghan C. Frank", "age": 48, "title": "Interim Co-CEO & CFO", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1168642, "exercisedValue": 121110, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Andre  Maestrini", "age": 61, "title": "Interim Co-CEO, President & Chief Commercial Officer", "yearBorn": 1964, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1232951, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Edward  Dagnese", "age": 59, "title": "Chief Supply Chain Officer", "yearBorn": 1966, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 865529, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Nicole  Neuburger", "age": 43, "title": "Chief Brand & Product Activation Officer", "yearBorn": 1982, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1099002, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ranju  Das", "age": 52, "title": "Chief AI & Technology Officer", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Howard Brett Tubin", "title": "Vice President of Investor Relations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercis