nited States. It offers cigarettes primarily under the Marlboro brand; large cigars and pipe tobacco under the Black & Mild brand; moist smokeless tobacco and oral tobacco products under the Copenhagen, Skoal, Red Seal, and Husky brands; oral nicotine pouches under the on! brand; and e-vapor products under the NJOY ACE brand. The company sells its products to distributors, as well as large retail organizations, such as chain stores. Altria Group, Inc. was founded in 1822 and is headquartered in Richmond, Virginia.', 5900.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Salvatore  Mancuso", "age": 60, "title": "CEO & Director", "yearBorn": 1965, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 3609274, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Heather A. Newman", "age": 48, "title": "Executive VP & CFO", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2344042, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Jody L. Begley", "age": 52, "title": "Executive VP & COO", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 3383920, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Charles N. Whitaker J.D.", "age": 58, "title": "Senior VP, Chief Human Resources Officer & Chief Compliance Officer", "yearBorn": 1967, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2539550, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. William F. Gifford Jr.", "age": 55, "title": "Consultant", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 10275278, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Daniel J. Bryant", "age": 55, "title": "VP, Senior Vice President Technology & Corporate Development and Treasurer", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Mac  Livingston", "title": "Vice President of Investor Relations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Robert A. McCarter III, J.D.", "age": 52, 