se company in North America, Europe, the Asia-Pacific, and internationally. It offers itineraries to destinations, such as Europe, Asia, Australia, New Zealand, South America, Africa, Canada, Bermuda, the Caribbean, and Alaska; and inter-island itinerary in Hawaii. The company also provides features, amenities, and activities, including various accommodations, dining venues, bars and lounges, spas, casino and retail shopping areas, and entertainment choices; shore excursions at each port of call, and air transportation and hotel packages for stays before or after a voyage. It offers its products and services under the Norwegian Cruise Line, Oceania Cruises, and Regent Seven Seas Cruises brands. The company was founded in 1966 and is based in Miami, Florida.', 44500.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. John W. Chidsey III, J.D.", "age": 62, "title": "President, CEO & Chairman", "yearBorn": 1963, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 144444, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Mark A. Kempa", "age": 53, "title": "Executive VP & CFO", "yearBorn": 1972, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2109415, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Daniel S. Farkas J.D.", "age": 56, "title": "Executive VP, General Counsel, Chief Development Officer & Secretary", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1638456, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Jason M. Montague", "age": 51, "title": "Chief Luxury Officer", "yearBorn": 1974, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2060269, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Captain Patrik  Dahlgren", "age": 48, "title": "Executive VP and Chief Vessel Operations & Newbuild Officer", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2109912, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Faye L. Ashby", "age": 53, "title": "Senior VP & Chief Accounting Officer", "yearBorn": 1972, "fiscalYear": 2025, "ex