 in the United States and internationally. The company offers Omnipod platform products comprising Omnipod 5 automated insulin delivery system, which includes a proprietary AID algorithm embedded in the pod that integrates with a third-party continuous glucose monitor to obtain glucose values through wireless Bluetooth communication; Omnipod DASH insulin management system that features a Bluetooth enabled pod that is controlled by a smartphone-like personal diabetes manager with a color touch screen user interface; and the Omnipod Insulin Management System. It also provides pods for Amgen for use in the Neulasta Onpro kit, which is a delivery system to help reduce the risk of infection after intense chemotherapy. The company sells its products to end-users through the pharmacy channel; and independent distributors. Insulet Corporation was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Acton, Massachusetts.', 5400.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Ashley A. McEvoy", "age": 54, "title": "CEO, President & Director", "yearBorn": 1971, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 3143232, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Flavia H. Pease", "age": 52, "title": "Executive VP & CFO", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1445280, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Eric  Benjamin", "age": 42, "title": "Executive VP & COO", "yearBorn": 1983, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1520956, "exercisedValue": 2887675, "unexercisedValue": 609940}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. John Wodick Kapples J.D.", "age": 65, "title": "Senior VP & General Counsel", "yearBorn": 1960, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1173658, "exercisedValue": 1177222, "unexercisedValue": 534116}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Prem  Singh", "age": 48, "title": "Senior Vice President of Global Operations", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 992670, "exercisedValue": 233157, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Amit  Guliani", "