managed real estate investment trust that began its operations as a publicly-traded REIT in 1993. The Company conducts substantially all of its operations, and owns, directly or indirectly, substantially all of its assets. Our business consists of acquiring, developing, owning, and operating income-producing retail real estate principally located in suburban trade areas with compelling demographics within the United States of America. Regency has been an S&P 500 Index member since 2017. We are a preeminent national owner, operator, and developer of neighborhood and community shopping centers. Our portfolio includes thriving properties merchandised with highly productive grocers, restaurants, service providers, and best-in-class retailers that connect with their neighborhoods, communities, and customers. Regency Centers Corporation was incorporated in 1963 and is based in Jacksonville, United States.', 503.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Martin E. Stein Jr.", "age": 72, "title": "Non Independent Executive Chairman of the Board", "yearBorn": 1953, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 540828, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Lisa  Palmer", "title": "President, CEO & Director", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 3993334, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Michael J. Mas CPA", "age": 49, "title": "Executive VP & CFO", "yearBorn": 1976, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2193074, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Alan Todd Roth", "age": 50, "title": "President of East Region & COO", "yearBorn": 1975, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1583938, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nicholas Andrew Wibbenmeyer", "age": 44, "title": "President of West Region & Chief Investment Officer", "yearBorn": 1981, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1576970, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Terah L. Devereaux", "age": 