s to treat various diseases worldwide. The company develops product candidates to treat eye, allergic and inflammatory, cardiovascular, metabolic, neurological, infectious, and rare diseases; and cancer, hematologic conditions. It also offers EYLEA injections for wet age-related macular degeneration and diabetic macular edema; myopic choroidal neovascularization; diabetic retinopathy; neovascular glaucoma; retinopathy of prematurity; Dupixent injection to treat atopic dermatitis and asthma; Libtayo injection for metastatic or locally advanced cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma; Praluent injection to treat heterozygous familial hypercholesterolemia (HoFH); and Kevzara solution for rheumatoid arthritis. It has license and collaboration agreement with Bayer for the development and commercialization of EYLEA 8 mg and EYLEA; Alnylam Pharmaceuticals, Inc. to discover, develop, and commercialize RNAi therapeutics for diseases by addressing therapeutic disease targets expressed in the eye and central nervous system; Intellia Therapeutics, Inc. to advance CRISPR/Cas9 gene-editing technology for in vivo therapeutic development for therapies focused on neurological and muscular diseases; Hansoh Pharmaceuticals Group Company Limited to acquire development and commercial rights for HS-20094, a dual GLP-1/GIP receptor; and Tessera Therapeutics, Inc. develops and commercializes TSRA-196, an investigational gene editing therapy for Alpha-1 antitrypsin deficiency. Additionally, the company has a strategic collaboration with Telix Pharmaceuticals Limited to develop and commercialize radiopharmaceutical therapies. The company was incorporated in 1988 and is based in Tarrytown, New York.', 15343.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Leonard S. Schleifer M.D., Ph.D.", "age": 72, "title": "Co-Founder, President, CEO & Co-Chairman", "yearBorn": 1953, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 7280549, "exercisedValue": 25189922, "unexercisedValue": 194887408}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. George D. Yancopoulos M.D., Ph.D.", "age": 65, "title": "Co-Founder, President, Chief Scientific Officer & Co-Chairman", "yearBorn": 1960, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 6949469, "exercisedValue": 21411500, "unexercisedValue": 194887408}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Christopher R. Fenimore CPA", "age": 54, "title": "Executive VP of Finance & CFO", "yearBorn": 1971, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1485636, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 20570296}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Joseph J. LaRosa J.D.", "age": 66, "title": "Executive VP, General Counsel & Secretary", "yearBorn": 1959, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2959826, "exercisedValue": 2616895, "unexercisedValue": 44087188}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Andrew J. Murphy Ph.D.", "age": 67, "title": "Executive VP of Research & Co-Chief Scientific Officer", "yearBorn": 1958, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1727634, "exercisedValue": 3260250, "unexercisedValue": 61848128}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Daniel P. Van Plew", "age": 52, "title": "Executive VP and GM of Industrial Operations & Product Supply", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2030778, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 13315421}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rajesh  Ahuja", "title": "Senior Vice President of Quality Assurance & Operations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ryan  Steinberger", "title": "Executive VP, Chief Digital & Technology Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ryan  Crowe", "title": "Senior Vice President of Investor Relations & Strategic Analysis", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Melissa  Lozner", "title": "Senior VP & Chief Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}]', 8.0, 10.0, 9.0, 10.0, 10.0, 1777593600.0, 1767139200.0, 'http://newsroom.regeneron.com/', '[]', 86400, 2, 638.88, 642.45, 632.76, 648.495, 63