s and protection to residential and commercial customers in the United States and internationally. The company offers pest control services to residential properties protecting from common pests, including rodents, insects, and wildlife. It also provides workplace pest control solutions for customers across various end markets, such as healthcare, food service, and logistics. In addition, the company offers termite protection and ancillary services for both residential and commercial customers. It serves clients directly, as well as through franchisee operations. The company was formerly known as Rollins Broadcasting, Inc and changed its name to Rollins, Inc. in 1965. Rollins, Inc. was founded in 1901 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.', 22000.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. John F. Wilson", "age": 67, "title": "Executive Chairman of the Board", "yearBorn": 1958, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1105256, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Jerry E. Gahlhoff Jr.", "age": 52, "title": "Principal Executive Officer, President, CEO & Director", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2838227, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Kenneth D. Krause CPA", "age": 49, "title": "Executive VP & CFO", "yearBorn": 1976, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1595007, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Elizabeth Brannen Chandler J.D.", "age": 61, "title": "Chief Legal Officer, General Counsel & Corporate Secretary", "yearBorn": 1964, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1064890, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. William W. Harkins", "age": 43, "title": "Chief Accounting Officer", "yearBorn": 1982, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Renee J. Pearson", "title": "Senior VP & Chief Information Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, 