in the sale of electricity. The company offers electric service to retail customers and wholesale customers; and energy-related products and services to natural gas choice markets. It also develops, constructs, acquires, owns, operates, and manages power generation assets, as well as battery energy storage projects; sells electricity at market-based rates in the wholesale market; and deploys microgrids for commercial, industrial, governmental, and utility customers. In addition, the company is involved in the distribution of natural gas in Illinois, Georgia, Virginia, and Tennessee; distributes energy and resilience solutions; and invests in telecommunications. The Southern Company was incorporated in 1945 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.', 29502.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Christopher C. Womack", "age": 67, "title": "CEO, President & Chairman", "yearBorn": 1958, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 5431992, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. David P. Poroch", "age": 55, "title": "Executive VP & CFO", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1599434, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Stanley W. Connally Jr.", "age": 56, "title": "Executive VP & COO", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2327228, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Daniel S. Tucker", "age": 55, "title": "Senior Advisor", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2442857, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Kimberly Scheibe Greene", "age": 59, "title": "Chairman, President & CEO of Georgia Power", "yearBorn": 1966, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2873203, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. J. Jeffrey Peoples", "age": 65, "title": "Chairman, President & CEO of Alabama Power Company", "yearBorn": 1960, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2460797, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}