 services in the Southeastern and Mid-Atlantic United States. The company operates through two segments, Consumer and Small Business Banking; and Wholesale Banking. Its deposit products include noninterest-bearing checking, interest-bearing checking, savings, and money market deposit accounts, as well as certificates of deposit and individual retirement accounts. The company also provides funding; asset management; credit card lending; home equity and mortgage lending; other direct retail lending; home mortgage lending; Investment brokerage services; mobile/online banking; payment solutions; point-of-sale lending; retail and small business deposit products; and small business lending. In addition, it offers asset-based lending, commercial deposit and treasury services; commercial lending; floor plan lending; derivatives; institutional trust services; insurance premium finance; international banking; investment banking and capital markets services; leasing; merchant services; mortgage warehouse lending; real estate lending; supply chain financing; and wealth management/private banking. The company was formerly known as BB&T Corporation and changed its name to Truist Financial Corporation in December 2019. Truist Financial Corporation was founded in 1872 and is headquartered in Charlotte, North Carolina.', 37877.0, '[{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. William Henry Rogers Jr.", "age": 67, "title": "Executive Chairman & CEO", "yearBorn": 1958, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 5756576, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Michael Baron Maguire", "age": 46, "title": "Senior EVP & CFO", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2532293, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Donta L. Wilson", "age": 49, "title": "Senior EVP and Chief Consumer & Small Business Banking Officer", "yearBorn": 1976, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2515294, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. 